@startuml player_playtime_input

package player {
  class Player {
    -- Fields --
    - playTimeSeconds: long
    - playTimeAccumulator: double
    - MAX_PLAY_SECONDS: long {static, final}
    - lastThrowKey: boolean
    - blockingLeft: boolean
    - state: PlayerState
    - heldBomb: ObjBomb
    - heldPot: ObjPot
    - heldRock: ObjRock
    - heldChicken: NpcChicken
    - currentShield: Entity
    - currentWeapon: Entity

    -- Methods --
    + updatePlayTime(deltaSeconds:double): void
    - isThrowKeyJustPressed(): boolean
    + isBlockingLeft(): boolean
    + hasLeftShield(): boolean
    + getPlayTimeSeconds(): long
    + setPlayTimeSeconds(seconds:long): void
    + getState(): PlayerState
    + setState(state:PlayerState): PlayerState
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getKeyHandler(): KeyHandler
    + getUi(): UI
    + getPlayer(): Player
  }
}

package input {
  class KeyHandler {
    + isThrowKeyPressed(): boolean
  }
}

package object {
  abstract class Obj {
    + getHeldSprite(): BufferedImage
    + getThrowSprite(dir:String, frame:int): BufferedImage
  }
  class ObjBomb extends Obj
  class ObjPot extends Obj
  class ObjRock extends Obj
}

package npc {
  class NpcChicken {
    + getHeldSprite(): BufferedImage
    + getThrowSprite(dir:String, frame:int): BufferedImage
  }
}

package ui {
  class UI {
    + getDamagePopupManager(): DamagePopupManager
    + addMessage(msg:String): void
  }
  class DamagePopupManager {
    + pop(text:String, x:int, y:int, variant:PopupVariant, duration:int): void
  }
}

package util {
  class FrameApp {
    + getTileSize(): int
    + getMaxWorldCol(): int
    + getMaxWorldRow(): int
  }
}

enum PlayerState {
  PLAY
  HOLD_WALK
  PICKUP
  THROW
  // ...
}

enum PopupVariant {
  HEAL
  MONSTER_DAMAGE
  PLAYER_DAMAGE
  XP
}

Player --> GameWindow : uses
Player --> KeyHandler : queries
Player --> ObjBomb : may hold
Player --> ObjPot : may hold
Player --> ObjRock : may hold
Player --> NpcChicken : may hold
GameWindow --> KeyHandler : provides
GameWindow --> UI : provides
UI --> DamagePopupManager : provides

note right of Player
**Notes**
- updatePlayTime: フレームごとの経過秒を蓄積して秒単位で playTimeSeconds を増やす。上限(MAX_PLAY_SECONDS)でカンストする。
- isThrowKeyJustPressed: 投擲キーの「押下開始」を検出するユーティリティ（前フレーム状態を保持）。
- isBlockingLeft / hasLeftShield: 左側ブロック状態と左手に盾を装備しているかを返す簡易ゲッター。

- updatePlayTime: Accumulate the frame's elapsed seconds and increment playTimeSeconds once per accumulated second; stop increasing when MAX_PLAY_SECONDS is reached (cap at max).
- isThrowKeyJustPressed: Utility that detects the throw key's rising edge by comparing the current key state with the previous frame's state and updates the stored previous state.
- isBlockingLeft: Simple getter that returns whether the player is currently blocking to the left.
- hasLeftShield: Simple getter that returns whether the player has a shield equipped in the left hand (checks getCurrentShield() and its type).
end note

@enduml